    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DESCRIPTION\r\nDavid Scally of David Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are pleased to present new to the market 77 Donard Road. This wonderful 3 bedroom mid-terrace home was built by Associate Properties in the late 1940`s. The property offers a practical layout and light filled living space and will appeal to a host of purchasers.\r\nNo. 77 Donard Road is ideally located in this mature and settled location. It is conveniently located close to a host of amenities including a selection of primary and secondary schools, shops including the Ashleaf Shopping centre and Crumlin Village and the soon to be new Crumlin Shopping Centre. The transport links are excellent as the property is within easy reach of the City Centre, it is well serviced by a regular bus service and the RED LUAS line is a pleasant 10 minute stroll awaystroll away. \r\nAccommodation comprises of entrance hallway, light filled front reception room with feature fireplace, beyond this is a large second reception room again with featured fireplace. Finally to complete the ground floor you will find a galley kitchen. \r\nTo the rear of the property is a large East facing garden with a lawn and surrounded but matures bushes and shrubs.\r\nUpstairs there are 3 generous sized bedrooms 2 large doubles and one single. There is also fully tiled family bathroom.\r\nEarly viewing of this property is highly recommended as interest will be high.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFEATURES.\r\nOff Street Parking\r\nDouble glazed throughout.\r\nExcellent location\r\nLarge rear garden"
      },
